(FIL-63: two of the three invalid Seek targets the manual names set the
 error flag - a position below 1, and an invalid descriptor
 (LANGUAGE.md:4014-4015). The third, a line past EOF, is asserted in
 'gen leaf file seek by line' alongside FIL-102, which is where the
 known-newline-count file this needs already lives. The invalid
 descriptor is the same in-range-but-never-opened literal FIL-43 already
 established as the compile-safe upper boundary (2147483647) - `open`
 against it never itself errors, only the first real operation on it
 does, which the manual is silent about but the compiler is consistent
 on (Discrepancy 3, resolved by vox #47). Probes: docs/ledger/probes/
 files/FIL-63.vox, D3.vox (re-hand-verified this batch under both
 compilers).)

